=== BDD-2: unclosed quote fails closed ===
gate_commands:
  P3: "python3 -m pytest agate/tests/ -q" # trailing
  P3x: "echo hi
--- variant A: value with residue quote ---
gate_commands:
  P3: "echo hi""
parser exit=2 (expect non-zero)
--- stdout ---
--- stderr ---
agate-read-gate-commands: 解析错误: P3 命令值引号未闭合: echo hi"
--- variant B: unclosed single quote ---
gate_commands:
  P3: "echo don't"
parser exit=2 (expect non-zero)
--- stdout ---
--- stderr ---
agate-read-gate-commands: 解析错误: P3 命令值引号未闭合: echo don't
EXIT_CODE: 0
